rce location, diagnostic, type alias 결과가 필요하다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:13:JSON manifest는 dependency query와 무효화가 복잡해지므로 로컬 SQLite DB를 workspace index로 사용한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:24:- 중복 component, ref 해소, cycle diagnostic의 최종 판단은 현재 파일 내용 기준으로 재계산 가능해야 한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:31:| `RefResolver` | 내부/외부 `$ref` 해소, pointer lookup, per-run cache, cycle stack, source pointer |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:32:| `SourceMapIndex` | YAML AST 기반 pointer → line/column 매핑 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:33:| `WorkspaceIndex` | 파일 hash, component, ref edge, diagnostics, type alias metadata 저장/조회 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:59:  pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:67:create table refs (\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:69:  from_pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:70:  ref_text text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:72:  to_pointer text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:74:  resolved integer not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:75:  diagnostic_code text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:76:  primary key (from_file, from_pointer, ref_text)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:81:  pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:84:  primary key (file_path, pointer)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:87:create table diagnostics (\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:90:  pointer text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:100:  source_pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:101:  ref_text text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:105:  primary key (source_file, source_pointer, ref_text)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:112:create index refs_to_file_idx on refs(to_file);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:113:create index refs_from_file_idx on refs(from_file);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:115:create index diagnostics_file_idx on diagnostics(file_path);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:121:   - entry spec, domain specs, profile specs, external ref 후보 파일을 수집한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:126:   - cache key에는 `oa-sdk` version, index schema version, resolver options, profile, override config, typegen options를 포함한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:129:   - changed/deleted file의 `components`, `refs`, `diagnostics`, `source_locations`, `type_aliases`를 삭제한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:130:   - `refs.to_file` 역방향 query로 영향을 받는 source file을 dirty 처리한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:133:   - YAML/JSON parse, source map 생성, component 수집, `$ref` edge 수집을 다시 수행한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:138:   - ref cycle은 DB edge를 읽어 메모리 graph DFS/Tarjan으로 판정한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:139:   - missing external ref는 resolver diagnostic으로 기록한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:142:   - validate는 dirty/impacted 파일 diagnostic을 갱신한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:143:   - typegen은 external alias/type output 영향이 있을 때 재생성한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:198:2. `resolveRefGraph()`를 resolver 기반으로 이전.\\ndocs/internal/ar