while callers keep traversal/folding behavior local.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:15:- Implemented focused resolver baseline tests for `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()` covering internal refs, external YAML/JSON refs, nested external refs, missing refs, circular refs, and `$ref` sibling preservation.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:16:- Added typegen baseline coverage for external YAML/JSON schema aliases, nested external aliases, and unresolved external schema diagnostics.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:17:- Documented current resolver/typegen paths and known behavior gaps in internal docs; updated test counts.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:19:  - `packages/parser/src/__tests__/resolver-baseline.test.ts`\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:25:  - `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()` share JSON Pointer resolution but keep separate traversal, cache, cycle stack, and diagnostic emission paths.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:26:  - `generateTypesFromSpec()` intentionally parses without deref; external component aliases are discovered by `analyzeExternalSchemaRefs()` through `resolveRefGraph()` and then wired into `schemaToTs()` via `refNameOverrides`.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:27:  - Typegen currently limits external alias generation to `#/components/schemas/*`, and unresolved external schema causes are collapsed into `external-schema-unresolved`.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:31:- Implemented a parser-internal shared `RefResolver` contract for internal refs, external YAML/JSON refs, JSON Pointer lookup, document cache keys, source pointer metadata, missing refs, and circular refs.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:32:- Rewired `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()` to use the shared resolver while preserving their public exports and caller-visible behavior.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:33:- Added contract-level tests for internal and external ref resolution, including YAML/JSON document caching and missing/circular diagnostics.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:34:- Updated internal docs and todo status for the completed resolver unification work and bumped parser/total test counts.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:36:  - `packages/parser/src/ref-resolver.ts`\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:37:  - `packages/parser/src/ref-graph.ts`\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:38:  - `packages/parser/src/deref.ts`\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:39:  - `packages/parser/src/__tests__/ref-resolver-contract.test.ts`\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:44:  - `resolveRefGraph()` owns graph traversal and node shaping; the shared resolver should only return resolution facts and diagnostics.\\n.ralph-tui/progress.md:45:  - `derefSpec()` owns sibling merge and cycle strategy; the shared resolver supplies the same cache key and diagnostic vocabulary used by the graph path.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:38:| `resolveRefGraph()` | 공유 `RefResolver` 기반 내부/외부 `$ref` 그래프 수집, nested external ref 추적, 누락/순환 diagnostic |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:39:| `derefSpec()` | 공유 `RefResolver` 기반 내부/외부 YAML/JSON `$ref` 인라인 전개, sibling 구조 정보 보존, `cycleStrategy` 지원 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:40:| `lintDocument()` | 7카테고리 17규칙 + ref graph diagnostic source 출력 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:41:| `validateDocument()` | 종합 검증 (파싱 + 린트 + JSON Schema 2020-12 메타 검증 + ref graph diagnostic) |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:42:| Query API | `findOperation`, `findByTag`, `describeApi`, `resolveServerUrl`, `groupByTag` |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:52:| Request schema preflight | `validateRequestSchemas` / `assertValidRequestSchemas` — mock 생성 시점에 request schema compile 검증 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:56:| Body 파싱 | JSON, form-urlencoded, multipart/form-data, text/plain |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:57:| 스트리밍 | SSE (data: + [DONE]) + NDJSON (bare JSON lines), `generateStreamChunks()` 공유 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:73:| ZodLazy → $ref | 재귀 스키마 지원 (refs 컨텍스트 기반) |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:75:| typegen | OAS → TS ($ref 참조, JSDoc, ResponseHeaders, Op 묶음 타입, Error 타입, tsc 검증) |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:80:| typegen external refs | 외부 YAML/JSON `$ref` schema alias 생성, 이름 충돌 시 파일명 기반 deterministic rename + 경고 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:90:| `RefResolver` | `packages/parser/src/ref-resolver.ts`의 `createRefResolver()` → `resolvePointer()` + external YAML/JSON document cache | parser 내부 contract. internal/external/unsupported kind, JSON Pointer, cache key/document cache key, source pointer, file/pointer metadata, missing/circular/read-failed diagnostic을 단일 결과 객체로 반환. public index에는 export하지 않음 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:91:| `resolveRefGraph()` | `packages/parser/src/ref-graph.ts`의 `collectRefs()` traversal → 공유 `RefResolver` | 내부 ref, 외부 YAML/JSON ref, 외부 파일 내부 nested ref를 graph node로 기록. 누락 pointer/read 실패와 순환은 diagnostic으로 기록하며 `$ref` sibling 내부 ref도 계속 수집 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:92:| `derefSpec()` | `packages/parser/src/deref.ts`의 `DerefFolder.foldRef()` → 공유 `RefResolver` + deref file cache/stack | 내부/외부 YAML/JSON ref를 인라인 전개하고 외부 파일 내부 상대 ref는 해당 파일 기준으로 해소. missing ref는 원본 `$ref` node 유지. 기본 cycle은 `{}`로 절단하고 `cycleStrategy: preserve-ref`는 ref 유지. `$ref` sibling은 해소 결과에 병합 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:93:| typegen external refs | `generateTypesFromSpec()` → `parseDocument()`(deref 없음) → `analyzeExternalSchemaRefs()` → `resolveRefGraph()` → `schemaToTs(refNameOverrides)` | 외부 `#/components/schemas/*` YAML/JSON schema를 generated alias로 추가. nested external schema alias도 생성. 이름 충돌/로컬 shadow는 deterministic rename warning. 해소 실패는 `external-schema-unresolved` diagnostic |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:104:NDJSON vs SSE 스트림 분리 + `resolveServerUrl` 서버 변수 해소.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:179:| 자체 린터 + ref graph | 3.2 원본 | 0 에러, 0 경고 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:180:| JSON Schema 메타 검증 | Schema Object | 2020-12 keyword 정합성 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:181:| Mock schema preflight | request body/parameter schema | mock 생성 전 AJV compile 오류 차단 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/packages.md:20:    references/    OAS 3.2 스펙 분할본\\ndocs/internal/architecture/packages.md:60:| `src/deref.ts` | $ref 역참조 + 순환 감지 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/packages.md:83:| `src/core/stream.ts` | SSE/NDJSON 스트리밍 |\\ndocs/internal/traceability.md