al/architecture/004-oas32-first.md:27:- 공식 스펙 원문을 `references/OpenAPI-Specification/` 서브모듈로 관리\\ndocs/internal/architecture/005-spectral-redocly-split.md:10:- `oas3-schema` — `$ref` 해석 전 소스를 검사하므로 path item `$ref` 거부\\ndocs/internal/architecture/005-spectral-redocly-split.md:13:- `oas3-examples-value-or-externalValue` — `dataValue`/`serializedValue` 오탐\\ndocs/internal/architecture/005-spectral-redocly-split.md:15:Redocly는 `$ref`를 resolve한 뒤 검증하므로 구조 오류를 더 정확히 잡음.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/005-spectral-redocly-split.md:24:oas3-examples-value-or-externalValue: off\\ndocs/internal/architecture/005-spectral-redocly-split.md:28:Redocly 담당: **구조 검증** ($ref 유효성, 스펙 준수)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:9:OAS 3.2 스펙은 도메인별 YAML, 외부 `$ref`, JSON Schema 2020-12 `$ref` sibling 보존, typegen external alias, schema meta validation을 함께 처리한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:12:증분 업데이트에는 이전 실행의 파일 hash, component 소유권, `$ref` edge, source location, diagnostic, type alias 결과가 필요하다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:13:JSON manifest는 dependency query와 무효화가 복잡해지므로 로컬 SQLite DB를 workspace index로 사용한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:24:- 중복 component, ref 해소, cycle diagnostic의 최종 판단은 현재 파일 내용 기준으로 재계산 가능해야 한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:31:| `RefResolver` | 내부/외부 `$ref` 해소, pointer lookup, per-run cache, cycle stack, source pointer |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:32:| `SourceMapIndex` | YAML AST 기반 pointer → line/column 매핑 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:33:| `WorkspaceIndex` | 파일 hash, component, ref edge, diagnostics, type alias metadata 저장/조회 |\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:59:  pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:67:create table refs (\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:69:  from_pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:70:  ref_text text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:72:  to_pointer text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:74:  resolved integer not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:75:  diagnostic_code text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:76:  primary key (from_file, from_pointer, ref_text)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:81:  pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:84:  primary key (file_path, pointer)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:87:create table diagnostics (\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:90:  pointer text,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:100:  source_pointer text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:101:  ref_text text not null,\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:105:  primary key (source_file, source_pointer, ref_text)\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:112:create index refs_to_file_idx on refs(to_file);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:113:create index refs_from_file_idx on refs(from_file);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:115:create index diagnostics_file_idx on diagnostics(file_path);\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:121:   - entry spec, domain specs, profile specs, external ref 후보 파일을 수집한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:126:   - cache key에는 `oa-sdk` version, index schema version, resolver options, profile, override config, typegen options를 포함한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:129:   - changed/deleted file의 `components`, `refs`, `diagnostics`, `source_locations`, `type_aliases`를 삭제한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:130:   - `refs.to_file` 역방향 query로 영향을 받는 source file을 dirty 처리한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:133:   - YAML/JSON parse, source map 생성, component 수집, `$ref` edge 수집을 다시 수행한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:138:   - ref cycle은 DB edge를 읽어 메모리 graph DFS/Tarjan으로 판정한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:139:   - missing external ref는 resolver diagnostic으로 기록한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:142:   - validate는 dirty/impacted 파일 diagnostic을 갱신한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:143:   - typegen은 external alias/type output 영향이 있을 때 재생성한다.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:198:2. `resolveRefGraph()`를 resolver 기반으로 이전.\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:199:3. `derefSpec()`를 resolver 기반으로 이전.\\ndocs/internal/goals/goal-1-schemas.md:46:| Redocly | $ref 해석 + 스펙 구조 검증 |\\npackages/mock-server/src/errors/types.ts:17:  // Mock 서버가 요청 검증용 JSON Schema를 컴파일할 수 없음\\npackages/mock-server/src/errors/types.ts:28:  /** JSONPath 형식 필드 경로 (e.g. \\\"/body/email\\\") */\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:6:- **Task Title**: Audit resolver paths and lock baseline behavior\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:7:- **Description**: As an OA SDK maintainer, I want the current resolver behavior mapped and protected by baseline tests so that later refactors do not silently change external ref, sibling, or cycle semantics.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:21:I’ll first read the repo guidance and existing progress notes, then trace the resolver/typegen paths before making any tests or docs changes.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:23:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"resolveRefGraph|derefSpec|typegen|external ref|external refs|\\\\\\\\\\\"'$ref\\\" . -g '\\\"...\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:25:The initial search shows the parser already has deref and ref graph coverage, while codegen’s `generate-types.ts` is the typegen path that calls both `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()`. I’m pulling the repo instructions and existing progress file next, including hidden paths.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:33:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,280p' packages/parser/src/ref-graph.ts\\\"\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:34:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/deref.ts\\\"\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:36:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/ref-graph.test.ts\\\"\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:37:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,420p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/deref.test.ts\\\"\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:43:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"externalSpecPath|nestedExternalSpecPath|collisionSpecPath|\\\\\\\\.yaml#/components/...\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:45:The implementation split is clear: parser `resolveRefGraph()` has its own traversal/cache, parser `derefSpec()` uses `DerefFolder` plus the ref graph pointer helper, and codegen `generateTypesFromSpec()` calls `analyzeExternalSchemaRefs()` which uses the ref graph and falls back to `derefSpec()` for external schemas. I’m going to add focused baseline tests around those exact boundaries and document the current gaps without changing runtime behavior. \\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d8